.TH SUSE 1.SH NAMEsuse \- show a program's usage line.SH SYNOPSIS\fBsuse\fRprogram.SH DESCRIPTION\fBsuse\fRshows the usage line of\fIprogram\fR.\fRMost programs here answer\fB\-?\fRwith their own usage directly, and with those\fBsuse\fRprints nothing and returns 0.  A 190-byte assembler program, from EFFOforum disk 2.